# Environment
#
# The frontend .env holds only VITE_* values, which ship in the browser bundle
# and are public by design — but it is still not committed, so that a secret
# added here later cannot leak by default. Backend secrets are covered by
# backend/.gitignore.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
